      heading
        text "Query plan —"
        text "EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN"
      paragraph
        text "The high-level strategy SQLite chose for this query. Indented items run"
        text "inside"
        text "their parent; sibling loops form nested joins, with each row from an outer loop driving a full pass of the loops below it."
      text "SCAN"
      text "SCAN events"
      text "Full table scan of “events”: SQLite visits every row in the table and tests it against the WHERE clause. Cost grows linearly with table size — fine for small tables, but on big tables this is th..."
      heading
        text "Bytecode —"
        text "EXPLAIN"
      paragraph
        text "SQLite compiles every statement into a program for its virtual machine (the VDBE); this is that program, one instruction per row. The"
        text "|"
        text "bars mark loop bodies. Instruction numbers are links — click one to jump to it, and the"
        text "↖ from n"
        text "badge on an instruction shows which other instructions jump to it. Hover a register like"
        text "r[3]"
        text "or a cursor to highlight everywhere else it is used."
      container
        checkbox [ref=558]
        text "Show explanations"
